   - The broader invariant about when the loop condition (size & (scale - 1)) == scale - 1 becomes true relative to available nodes.

   The method itself does not include any null-guards or structural checks that would *prevent* right.parent from being null. The correctness relies on external invariants.

6. Missing information
   We are missing:
   - The declaration and lifecycle of fields: stack, size, leavesToSkip, leavesSkipped.
   - Class invariants or documentation specifying that:
